   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>The Legal Working Group aims to design and execute a coherent legal strategy for the TE Commons Hatch, bonding curve mints and burns and proposal distribution. Additionally, we research other legal strategies or pertinent smart contracts that similar projects are doing. We also help with mapping/identifying the common must-have docs for TE activities (TEbook, TEacademy) prior to the Hatch to ensure consistency and coherency.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Meetings: Fridays at 4pm CET</li>\n<li>Where? <a href=\"https://discord.gg/yZsPfvRnDX\">TEC-Legal Discord voice channel</a>\n</li>\n<li>WG Lead: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/santigs\">@santigs</a>\n</li>\n<li>Discussions happen on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TyBgfZ8zWC\">tec-legal chat</a>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SqBWgu1WnwbKWBC5nubhCjDwf-TjRnunhev0kWUepAU/edit#heading=h.4qr126s3qfr1\">Legal WG Manifesto</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15IJvq8iqE7CWVhTw8cwd45In8e_kws3tTcyoRtDwDfg/edit#\">Agenda</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/launching-in-2-parts-first-hatch-dandelion-then-vote-to-add-abc-cv/85/10\">Hatching Phase Diagram</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jJAlLi6zE4lktvnzyloscNyyDc9UHPy6BuhI7yT-Qv0/edit\">Steps to Become a Hatcher </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TECommons/coordination/projects/1\">Github board of issues</a></li>\n</ul>",
